{
 "uid": "utm-obs-02-workloads",
 "title": "02 - Kubernetes Workloads",
 "description": "**Purpose:** workload-level detail for Deployments, StatefulSets, DaemonSets, Pods and Containers. Use after *01 - Platform Health* narrows the problem to a namespace.\n\n**Data sources:** Prometheus (kube-state-metrics, cAdvisor via kubelet).\n\n**Limitations:** these are INFRASTRUCTURE metrics. There are no application-level request rate / error / latency metrics because UTM services expose no Prometheus endpoints and no ServiceMonitor targets them. See *08 - Observability Coverage*.\n\n**Variables:** $namespace and $pod filter every panel on this dashboard.",
 "tags": [
  "utm-observability",
  "workloads"
 ],
